<title>UK: LME sets February 1997 launch date for TAPOs.</title>
<headline>LME sets February 1997 launch date for TAPOs.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The London Metal Exchange (LME) said that traded average price options (TAPOs) will be launched on Monday February 3 1997.</p>
<p>Copper and aluminium will commence trading, with the first month being February, and contracts tradeable out for a further 27 months, the LME said.</p>
<p>TAPOs will fall within the Terminal Markets Order and will be treated as zero rated for VAT, it said.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom, +44 171 542 8080</p>
